{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊代表余翠怡於女子A級重劍個人賽，為港隊奪得一面銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n余翠怡四強面對韓國劍手權曉京，雙方比分接近，中段余翠怡落後7:8，到賽事尾段，雙方打成14平手，決勝一劍由權曉京勝出，余翠怡以14:15僅敗。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n賽事不設銅牌賽，余翠怡為港隊增添一面銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:42:05.276371+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:15:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:49.506149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:45.843461+00:00","content_hash":"e7e68c6058a9ba0a558d161d59fff880ffae4bd4fb4f42b12059d2e4e5ffcd8a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}